<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Vaelor Trading LLC — Master Operational Manual &amp; Autonomous Execution Specification"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/vaelor-mark.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"><title>Vaelor Trading LLC — Operating Manual — Vaelor Trading LLC</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/BaseLayout.CglkzHiO.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.C6TZ0MOv.css"></head><body class="landing"><main class="land-wrap" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><!-- ======= Top-left toolbar ======= --><nav class="topbar" aria-label="Primary" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><a href="/" class="brand" style="text-decoration:none" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><img src="/vaelor-logo.png" alt="" width="30" height="30" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><span class="brand-id" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span style="display:block" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Vaelor Trading LLC</span><span class="sub" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>OPS v2.0.1</span></span></a><span class="tb-sep" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span><a class="tb-link" href="/docs" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Docs</a><a class="tb-link" href="/dashboard" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Dashboard</a><a class="tb-link" href="/terminal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Terminal</a><a class="tb-link" href="/docs/company-code" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Code</a><a class="tb-link" href="#ai" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>AI</a></nav><!-- ======= Auto-hiding search panel ======= --><div class="search-dock" id="searchDock" data-search data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></circle><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg><input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search the manual…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Search" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="search-results" id="searchResults" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></div></div><!-- ======= Hero ======= --><section class="hero" id="hero" aria-label="Hero" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="shell hero-inner" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="hero-copy" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="kicker" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Algorithmic Futures Trading &middot; Operational Protocol</div><h1 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Precision that<em data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>thinks.</em></h1><p class="lede" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Master Operational Manual &amp; Autonomous Execution Specification — macro analysis, bounded autonomous execution, risk control, and futures market structure analytics.</p><div class="badges" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="badge ok" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Version 2.0.1</span><span class="badge" style="font-family:var(--mono)" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>TLLC-OPS-V2.0.1-FINAL</span><span class="badge warm" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Confirmed · Deployment Ready</span></div><div class="btn-row" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Open Documentation</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/dashboard" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Launch Dashboard</a></div></div></div><div class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Scroll</span><span class="cue-line" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></span></div></section><!-- ======= Stats ======= --><section class="shell section-block" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="stat-grid reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="num" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>6</div><div class="lbl" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Departments</div></div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="num" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>10</div><div class="lbl" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Operational Roles</div></div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="num" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>5</div><div class="lbl" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Macro Regimes</div></div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="num" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>4</div><div class="lbl" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Dashboard Panels</div></div><div class="stat" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="num" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>7</div><div class="lbl" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Config Hooks</div></div></div></section><!-- ======= Departments ======= --><section class="shell section-block" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="kicker" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Organisation</div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Six departments, one mandate</h2></div><div class="grid grid-3" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:0ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M3 13.5h18M3 9h18M3 19h12" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>EXEC</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Executive Management</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Sovereign administrative authority, system override, and final governance.</p></div><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:60ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M12 3l9 4v5c0 5-3.8 8.3-9 10-5.2-1.7-9-5-9-10V7z" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>RISK</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Risk Management</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Parametric exposure enforcement, circuit-breaker triggers, anomaly monitoring.</p></div><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:120ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6z" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>EXEC_AUTO</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Automated Execution</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>High-frequency algorithmic order execution within bounded limits.</p></div><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:180ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M3 21h18M5 17l5-5 4 3 5-7M3 3v18" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>MACRO</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Macro Analysis</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Multi-asset macroeconomic data ingestion, regime synthesis, briefing generation.</p></div><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:240ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-8M22 20H2" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>MKT_STRUCT</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Market Structure</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Futures OI tracking, COT pipeline, composite signal dashboards.</p></div><div class="card dept reveal" style="transition-delay:300ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="dept-top" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="dept-ic" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><path d="M12 8v8m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme></path></svg></span><span class="meta" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>PERF_AUDIT</span></div><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Performance &amp; Audit</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Trade reconciliation, scorecards, behavioral pattern detection.</p></div></div></section><!-- ======= Regime states ======= --><section class="shell section-block" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="kicker" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Macro Engine</div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Regime synthesis states</h2></div><div class="regime-row reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="regime-pill" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>reflation</span><span class="regime-pill" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>disinflation</span><span class="regime-pill" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>stagflation</span><span class="regime-pill" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>goldilocks</span><span class="regime-pill" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>risk-off</span></div><p style="color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:14px; max-width:640px" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Output of weighted multi-indicator convergence — never a single release. Each regime call ships with a definitive invalidation condition.</p></section><!-- ======= Key controls ======= --><section class="shell section-block" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="kicker" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Safety Layer</div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Key controls at a glance</h2></div><ul class="mini-list" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:0ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>CIRCUIT</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Execution Freeze</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>when anomaly score S<sub>anomaly</sub> &gt; 0.85</span></li><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:50ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>CAPITAL</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Capital Scale Changes</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>&gt; 15% delta require Board override + multi-party cryptographic authorization</span></li><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:100ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>COT</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Positioning Extremes</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>flagged at |Z<sub>COT</sub>| ≥ 2.0 (3-year rolling z-score)</span></li><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:150ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>OI</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>OI Shock</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>flagged at ΔOI ≥ ±5% single session (default, configurable ±1%–±15%)</span></li><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:200ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>FLAG</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Composite Signal</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Aligned (3 criteria) · Watch (2) · None (&lt; 2)</span></li><li class="reveal" style="transition-delay:250ms" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><span class="tag" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>RE-ARM</span><b data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>System Re-Arming</b> <span data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>requires dual cryptographic signatures (PSO + Risk Controller)</span></li></ul></section><!-- ======= AI layer ======= --><section class="shell section-block" id="ai" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="kicker" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>AI Layer · MCP</div><h2 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Published analysis</h2></div><!-- populated by client-side fetch to MCP worker API (see script below) --><div id="ai-analysis" class="ai-pending reveal" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><h3 data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>No analysis published yet</h3><p data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Connect this site to your AI over MCP and let it publish results with <code data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>publish_analysis</code>. The AI reads the manual here, you train it, it analyzes — the site shows the results.</p><pre id="ai-setup" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Loading MCP API URL…</pre></div></section></main><script type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.C0kqLNGj.js"></script><footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell"><div class="mono">VAELOR TRADING LLC · MASTER OPERATIONAL MANUAL &amp; AUTONOMOUS EXECUTION SPECIFICATION</div><div class="mono" style="margin-top:6px">Version 2.0.1 · Standard Identifier <span style="color:var(--accent-warm)">TLLC-OPS-V2.0.1-FINAL</span> · Classification: Operational Protocol</div></div></footer><script type="module">function e(){if(document.querySelector(`canvas[data-matrix-bg]`))return;let e=document.createElement(`canvas`);e.setAttribute(`data-matrix-bg`,``),e.className=`bg-matrix`,e.setAttribute(`aria-hidden`,`true`),document.body.prepend(e);let t=e.getContext(`2d`);if(!t)return;let n=0,r=[],i=0,a=()=>window.matchMedia(`(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`).matches,o=a();function s(){e.width=Math.floor(window.innerWidth/2),e.height=Math.floor(window.innerHeight/2),n=Math.ceil(e.width/